inite high-rise buildings of various types and with different challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Repair the helicopter: modify and improve the HC-27 to escape, transport more goods and fly longer distances </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Confront the dreamers: The mutated humans that dwell in the darkness will try to get you. You must fight them, lure them, immobilize them, hide from them, deter them and stall them until sunrise redeems you - for another day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Carefully plan ahead in order to survive the night. Special floors that can be found in the buildings allow for extra valuable loot or special interactions</p></li></ul>",
